In a corpus this size the heaviest 'hubs' are mostly templated text repeated across
documents — the same clause in forty contracts — which crowds every search that touches
it. At millions of vectors the geometric kind appears as well: chunks that sit near the
centre of the space and turn up for everything. Both are found the same way, by counting.
